# Regression vectors added during review (expected values derived from SPEC.md).
### A3-deadband-return-is-strict
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 31
s 2 28
s 3 27.9
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@1:31.000
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@3:27.900
